>> title: Paratha
>> category: Flatbreads & Pancakes
>> tags: bread, indian, ghee, layered, griddle
>> counters: Curry House
>> aka: parantha, lachha paratha, malabar paratha, layered flatbread
>> pairs-with: chana-masala
>> servings: 6
>> time: 1 hr
>> step.4: roll thin, brush with ghee, pleat and coil
>> step.5: roll out, fry in ghee 2 min per side

Whisk @atta{2%cup}(240 g; Indian whole wheat flour) with @fine sea salt{1%tsp}(6 g).

Knead @&(~1)flour{}, @ghee{2%Tbsp}(28 g), and @warm water{3/4%cup}(180 mL) into a soft dough.

Rest @&(~1)dough{} covered ~{30%min}.

Roll @&(~1)dough{} thin, brush with @melted ghee{3%Tbsp}(40 g), dust with @rice flour{2%tsp}(6 g; or dry atta), then pleat and coil.

Roll @&(~1)coils{} into 7-in rounds and fry on a #tawa{} with @ghee for the pan{2%Tbsp}(28 g) ~{2%min} per side.
